# Raw output of runs still in progress stays out of git.
# Frozen snapshots, smoke trials and the freeze record go in, so every result can be tied to its raw data.
*/results/*
!langgraph/results/expA-round1/
!langgraph/results/expA-round1-rev6-posthoc/
!langgraph/results/smoke/
!langgraph/results/smoke-x*/
!langgraph/results/expA/
langgraph/results/expA/*
!langgraph/results/expA/FREEZE.json
!langgraph/results/expA/FREEZE-NOTES.txt
!langgraph/results/expA/frozen/
!langgraph/results/expA/batch.log
!langgraph/results/expA-rev6/
langgraph/results/expA-rev6/*
!langgraph/results/expA-rev6/FREEZE.json
**/.langgraph_api/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# n8n test values (throwaway, local only) and the API key the spike creates
n8n/n8n-test.env
n8n/*.secret
# n8n feasibility runs (not scored trials): kept as the raw data behind n8n/SPIKE-RESULTS.md
!n8n/results/
!n8n/results/spike-*/
!n8n/results/feasibility2-*/
!n8n/results/feasibility3-*/
# n8n fast-mode smoke runs (11 Oct): exploratory plumbing runs, kept so their original outputs survive re-scoring (n8n/SMOKE-RUNS-2026-10-11.md)
!n8n/results/XB-fast-*/
